    <p class="text-body-lg text-body mb-8">Arm pain — especially tennis elbow, golfer's elbow, and generalized forearm fatigue — is one of the most common complaints among regular pickleball players. While proper technique and conditioning are essential, your equipment choices play a significant role. The right combination of <a href="/blog/paddle-weight-guide/" class="text-link font-medium hover:underline">paddle weight</a>, <a href="/blog/core-thickness-explained/" class="text-link font-medium hover:underline">core thickness</a>, and <a href="/blog/how-to-measure-grip-size/" class="text-link font-medium hover:underline">grip size</a> can help reduce vibration and impact shock.</p>

    <!-- Prominent Medical Disclaimer -->
    <div class="my-6 p-5 rounded-lg bg-warning-soft/30 border border-warning/40 text-body-sm text-ink">
      <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
